.TITLE "mdfind"

.DIV "DESCRIPTION"
Searches for files using the Spotlight metadata indexing system. It provides high-speed search capabilities by querying the __metadata__ stored on the filesystem instead of scanning directories.

.DIV "TLDR"
**mdfind query**
Searches for files and directories matching a specific text string.
> __query__ the search term

**mdfind -name filename**
Searches for files with a specific name regardless of their content.
> __-name__ name search flag | __filename__ the name to match

**mdfind -onlyin directory query**
Limits the search results to a specific directory path.
> __-onlyin__ scope flag | __directory__ the target path | __query__ search term

.DIV "SUMMARY"
Because it utilizes the Spotlight index, __mdfind__ is significantly faster than the standard __find__ command for most common desktop searches.

.DIV "SEE ALSO"
**linux:find**

